  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f3e4ce6e61a06615",
      "translationZh": "将更多应用连接到搜索",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c9bbeb7400594e1d",
      "translationZh": "你将能够直接在 AI 模式中安全地关联常用服务并与之交互。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e428879568fd8b0c",
      "translationZh": "搜索高级产品经理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8777b0dc343d58be",
      "translationZh": "搜索工程负责人",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a21b58ba4c2f878a",
      "translationZh": "你的浏览器不支持音频元素。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9396d34c840bf012",
      "translationZh": "此内容由 Google AI 生成。生成式 AI 尚处于实验阶段",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "777e65bdb282fd27",
      "translationZh": "现在，你可以将喜爱的应用直接连接到搜索中的 AI 模式，完成更多任务。只需关联 Instacart、Canva 或 YouTube Music 等服务，即可创建清单、开展设计项目或精心编排播放列表，而无需离开搜索结果页面。立即前往搜索中的 AI 模式，开始使用这些新的集成功能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6b43a10482221e5d",
      "translationZh": "摘要由 Google AI 生成。生成式 AI 尚处于实验阶段。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7a4f1a754f6687c9",
      "translationZh": "“将更多应用连接到 Search”让你可以将服务直接关联到 AI Mode。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "caa09379d4d843a5",
      "translationZh": "关联你喜爱的应用，简化购买食品杂货或筹划活动等日常任务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b7873552674af9db",
      "translationZh": "将食材添加到你的 Instacart 购物车，或即刻在 Canva 中查找设计模板。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f595d3406ace6ab9",
      "translationZh": "创建个性化的 YouTube Music 播放列表，无需离开搜索结果页面即可开始收听。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6a47d69ef432a960",
      "translationZh": "今天就试试 AI Mode 中的这些新集成功能，轻松完成更多任务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "383f79b7698d21ec",
      "translationZh": "现在，你可以将喜爱的应用直接关联到 AI in Search，更快地完成任务。例如，你可以将食品杂货添加到购物车，或保存音乐播放列表，而无需离开搜索页面。这让项目规划或派对筹备变得轻松多了。只需前往 AI in Search 即可试用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f344ef9188695765",
      "translationZh": "探索其他风格：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bc18b39939a4a3da",
      "translationZh": "你已经可以将一些喜爱的服务连接到 Gemini 应用，而现在，为了帮助你完成更多任务，我们正让你能够直接在 Search 中连接你的应用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "daf5d333e06347d7",
      "translationZh": "本周起，这项功能将在美国逐步推出，让你可以直接在 AI Mode 中安全地关联一些常用服务并与之互动。来看看 Search 中的这些集成如何让你的日常生活更轻松：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "08805c521073468b",
      "translationZh": "假设你正在筹备一场烧烤聚会，并使用 AI Mode 来帮你制定食品杂货采购清单。如果你关联了 Instacart，就可以将食材直接加入 Instacart 购物车，只需在其应用或网站上轻点几下即可结账。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a4171fd57b070057",
      "translationZh": "借助 Personal Intelligence 和你已关联的应用，Search 可以提供更加个性化的回答。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "89a37e692dcc6e2b",
      "translationZh": "或者，如果你正在进行一个需要一些设计构思的项目，比如制作传单，你可以请 Canva 展示一些模板选项。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "38adf41cf1dcf659",
      "translationZh": "想为下一场派对打造完美的背景音乐吗？你可以使用 AI Mode 精心挑选歌曲、编成播放列表，立即将其保存到 YouTube Music，然后按下播放键，开启庆祝时刻。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0729d717aac46a7b",
      "translationZh": "今天就前往 Search 中的 AI Mode，试用新推出的关联应用功能。我们正在与多家合作伙伴携手合作，期待很快推出更多应用的接入。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "ba07e0e30582b629",
      "translationZh": "在收件箱中获取 Google 的最新资讯",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d1c2f6429af68386",
      "translationZh": "完成了。只差最后一步。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "177af4ad1775d8ae",
      "translationZh": "请查看收件箱，确认您的订阅。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5ff091e7a47df15e",
      "translationZh": "您也可以通过 来订阅。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "20d789c76dbc177d",
      "translationZh": "起飞出发：2026 年假日旅行趋势与贴士",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fefef2f9c6cb957b",
      "translationZh": "我们在 2026 年 9 月公布的最新 AI 动态",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "32e8c5bf32025e97",
      "translationZh": "Search 帮您完善居家咖啡制作日常的 5 种方式",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
